\CJKunderline{珈沂}將一條白繩的 $\frac{3}{8}$ 與一條紅繩的 $\frac{1}{3}$ 重疊並以膠帶黏合，形成一條長度為 238 公分的繩子。求黏合前，兩條繩子原本相差\rule[-2ex]{3cm}{0.4pt}\raisebox{-0.8ex}{\makebox[0pt][r]{\makebox[3cm][c]{\textbf{(16)}}}}公分。
\begin{center}
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm, y=1cm, >=stealth]
    \draw[dashed, thick] (3, 1.5) -- (3, -1.5);
    \draw[dashed, thick] (5, 1.5) -- (5, -1.5);
    \draw[ultra thick] (0.5, 0.7) -- (5, 0.7);
    \node[above] at (1.8, 0.7) {白繩};
    \draw[ultra thick] (3, -0.3) -- (8, -0.3);
    \node[above] at (6.7, -0.3) {紅繩};
    \node[below] at (4, -0.8) {重疊黏合處};
\end{tikzpicture}
\end{center}

\CJKunderline{佩佩}將 $a$、$b$ 兩個正整數做質因數分解，完整的做法如附圖所示。已知 $g > f > 1$，且 $a$、$b$ 的最大公因數是 $21$，最小公倍數是 $126$，則 $a + b=$\rule[-2ex]{3cm}{0.4pt}\raisebox{-0.8ex}{\makebox[0pt][r]{\makebox[3cm][c]{\textbf{(6)}}}}。
\begin{center}
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1.2cm, y=0.6cm]
    \draw (0.6,0) -- (0.6,-1) -- (2.5,-1);
    \node at (0.3,-0.5) {$3$};
    \node at (1.3,-0.5) {$a$};
    \node at (2.1,-0.5) {$b$};
    \draw (0.8,-1) -- (0.8,-2) -- (2.5,-2);
    \node at (0.5,-1.5) {$e$};
    \node at (1.3,-1.5) {$c$};
    \node at (2.1,-1.5) {$d$};
    \node at (1.3,-2.5) {$f$};
    \node at (2.1,-2.5) {$g$};
\end{tikzpicture}
\end{center}

附圖數線上的 $O$ 是原點，$A$、$B$、$C$ 三點所表示的數分別為 $a$、$b$、$c$。根據圖中各點的位置比較 $|a|$、$|b|$、$|c|$ 的大小關係為\rule[-2ex]{3cm}{0.4pt}\raisebox{-0.8ex}{\makebox[0pt][r]{\makebox[3cm][c]{\textbf{(22)}}}}。
\begin{center}
\begin{tikzpicture}[xscale=0.8, yscale=1]
    \draw[->, >=stealth, thick] (-4.5,0) -- (4.5,0);
    \draw (0,0.15) -- (0,-0.15) node[below=3pt] {$O(0)$};
    \draw (-2,0.15) -- (-2,-0.15) node[below=3pt] {$A(a)$};
    \draw (1.4,0.15) -- (1.4,-0.15) node[below=3pt] {$B(b)$};
    \draw (3.8,0.15) -- (3.8,-0.15) node[below=3pt] {$C(c)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
\end{center}

附表是七年廿三班八位同學的某次數學小黃卷成績與全班平均成績的比較表。試問八位同學中，最高分與最低分相差 \rule[-2ex]{3cm}{0.4pt}\raisebox{-0.8ex}{\makebox[0pt][r]{\makebox[3cm][c]{\textbf{(1)}}}} 分。
\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}
\hline
學生 & A & B & C & D & E & F & G & H \\ \hline
成績與全班平均成績的差距 & $-9$ & $-6$ & $-5$ & $-2$ & $+3$ & $+11$ & $+13$ & $+19$ \\ \hline
\end{tabular}
\end{center}

分別寫出下圖中數線上 $A$、$B$、$C$、$D$、$E$ 各點的坐標。（數線上位置與坐標形式均需寫出）
\begin{center}
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1.2cm, y=1cm, >=stealth]
    \draw[->, thick] (-5.6, 0) -- (4.6, 0);
    \foreach \x in {-5,-4,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,4} {
        \draw[thick] (\x, 0.15) -- (\x, -0.15) node[below=2pt] {\large \x};
    }
    \foreach \i in {1,...,9} { \draw (-4 + \i*0.1, 0.08) -- (-4 + \i*0.1, -0.08); }
    \foreach \i in {1,...,3} { \draw (-2 + \i*0.25, 0.08) -- (-2 + \i*0.25, -0.08); }
    \foreach \i in {1,2} { \draw (-1 + \i*0.3333, 0.08) -- (-1 + \i*0.3333, -0.08); }
    \foreach \i in {1,...,4} { \draw (3 + \i*0.2, 0.08) -- (3 + \i*0.2, -0.08); }
    \filldraw (-3.4, 0) circle (2.5pt) node[above=4pt] {\Large $C$};
    \filldraw (-1.25, 0) circle (2.5pt) node[above=4pt] {\Large $B$};
    \filldraw (-0.6667, 0) circle (2.5pt) node[above=4pt] {\Large $E$};
    \filldraw (1.5, 0) circle (2.5pt) node[above=4pt] {\Large $A$};
    \filldraw (3.6, 0) circle (2.5pt) node[above=4pt] {\Large $D$};
\end{tikzpicture}
\end{center}

下表為\CJKunderline{大興電器行}的促銷活動傳單，已知促銷第一天美食牌微波爐賣出 10 台，且其銷售額為 61000 元。若活動期間此款微波爐總共賣出 50 台，則其總銷售額為多少元？
\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{|c|}
\hline
\textbf{美食牌微波爐} \\
原價 \CJKsout{7800} 元 \quad 特價中 \\ 限量 50 台！ \\
前 20 台每台再折 800 元 \\
\hline
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
